Hello friends, how are you guys doing? I have some great news to share with you!
I've made a huge and FREE massive update for Razortron 2000, basically remade the entire game!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/26504646/501ae46dccc5d29856362dddae9f63bd8f6fc2cd.gif[/img]
[b]Here's what changed:[/b]
[list]
[*]Changed the engine to Game Maker 2, to improve compatibility of the game;
[*]Now, all the cars differs the specs and gameplay from each other;
[*]New Graphics for the entire game;
[*]Gameplay and Controls improved;
[*]New dynamic camera;
[*]Path creation system remade, allowing for more varied paths;
[*] New Original soundtrack;
[*]8 available languages: English, Portuguese, German, Russian, Simplified Chinese, French, Spanish, Korean! (please, let me know if you find any issues with the localization)
[*]and much more! [/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/26504646/5809d24bd8108d1615739dee3738a0e21a433326.gif[/img]

If you want to restart the achievements to enjoy the new version, just go to the options menu and restart the progress. 

As I did with Cyberhunt, i kept the original version of the game accessible (on the launch options), so if you want to keep your progress you can play the previous version;

If you enjoy what I'm doing and want to support my work, please check and wishlist (if you like it) my upcoming game:
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1915690/Burning_Skies/

You can also send your feedback to my discord server:  [url=discord.nukgames.com]discord.NukGames.com[/url]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/7243354/b30bfedd3982f40f6be2a6046c512e8fe35783e4.gif[/img]

Hello friends, the new [b]SHAPESHOOTER[/b] update - Ver. 1.01 is now available!

[b]Here's what changed:[/b]
[list][*]Changed the artstile on the Planet selection menu to fit more the game artstyle;
[*]Checkpoints reviewed and new added in every stage;
[*]AI improved for the circle enemies;
[*]Improved the turret control to work better with analog controller, (it was limited to 8 directions, and now it's completely free);
[*]Added a slider to change the turret rotation speed;
[*]Mouse now are locked inside the game screen;
[*]New mouse recticle;
[*]Improved the navigation through the menus and prompt shown;
[*]Stage selection screen info and Player's gears position;
[*]Game time counter only works during the gameplay;
[*]Little bug are not shown after the endgame;
[/list]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143900/Shapeshooter/
